 "remarks": "Nestled on 1.03 acres on a quiet neighborhood cul-de-sac in desirable North Stamford, this spacious 5-bedroom, 2.5-bath Contemporary offers approximately 4,150 square feet of living space and a wonderful blend of privacy, comfort, and functionality. Step inside to discover a thoughtfully designed layout featuring hardwood floors, two fireplaces, central air conditioning, and generously sized living areas ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. The home offers an abundance of closet space and storage throughout, along with convenient features including a laundry chute from the second floor to the first-floor laundry area, central vacuum system, electric air filter, trash compactor, and garbage disposal. Outdoors, enjoy your own private retreat featuring an in-ground swimming pool and an expansive wood deck, perfect for hosting gatherings, summer entertaining, or simply relaxing in the peaceful surroundings. The large, dry basement, currently enjoyed as a home gym, provides additional versatile space to suit a variety of needs. Additional highlights include a two-car under-house garage and a storage shed for added convenience. Set in a picturesque North Stamford neighborhood, this property offers an exceptional combination of generous living space, thoughtful amenities, and inviting indoor-outdoor living. Sale contingent upon contract owners ability to take title (no title issues).",
